{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6e577eb0411561ea35ee96ce3eeca62baf87b57d5633df617f94132894a2487c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4c686d6b5eeb2206f69323c860bc9eb5747cb7c240545761eccd9dd4a8241c8",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父，辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33e3ff0c5d2c35f5c4670e2b0824002906294089a6da2c8aba37ab292d4d9ebe",
      "text": "我接下来准备和实还有翔真一起去店里，\n师父如果不介意的话，要不要也来吃碗拉面？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08e5bfcc984d1e9c899368a2253f28c77d29f0626fd2a66e2a309bc38bb5b57e",
      "text": "好啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2ec0290885aafccce5cb7475b9c6fbc3a76faffe2adca18bc1cc24e369f78f9",
      "text": "我去吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a9038f627a5c0304605ed911bc947d10be960a1662514180a2c5f3e715078c",
      "text": "好，那就这么定了！\n我们大概还有1小时左右能到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0112da9a121ade320f1cdd95d2e0b76143da7ece3ef80c7ffd9946789655f0c0",
      "text": "我现在在花店，过一会儿就出发。\n……师父觉得我出现在这里很稀奇吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:265b79ba4e9eee57ff6a0c5501d5969b05e2b6cc7a779e37e4c7faa914a3db43",
      "text": "其实是因为工作聊到了花，我想着要在自己店里\n也摆上一些装饰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea2affd97764f383808347860b9440ea9bde51b608be16f328ff5ff97d5c557",
      "text": "所以就让他们俩帮忙出谋划策了。\n师父要是也能来看看就太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:731a537bc2efd92f6453244c3b4d13ce479a3837a8adf236b8cb816774b92fc8",
      "text": "到店之前我们再联络你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_403_2_4_039_03_09_c:2_4_039_03_09_c:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:441f4a79ce9f1f8082eb20442e5250decc6daec1e7d4ca21e585cbec0f6cfb09",
      "text": "如果师父会先到的话，\n希望能告诉我一声。那么，待会儿见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
